{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Survival: Folded Space</strong><br>In a post-apocalyptic wasteland, you drive a lone RV north, chasing the faint hope of survival. Deadly weather, lethal viruses, and relentless zombies make every trip outside a gamble with your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your RV is more than a vehicle \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>mobile base with expandable folded space</strong>. Inside, you can plant crops, raise animals, craft equipment, and build living or defensive facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wasteland and abandoned ruins to find rare resources and mysterious \u201cfolded space\u201d entrances. These hidden dimensions hold the energy and materials you need to maintain and expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every mile you travel, survival grows harder. Plan your resources carefully, fight off the undead, and keep your home on wheels safe as you push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Base</strong> \u2013 Drive your RV with expandable interior space and build a safe, cozy home on wheels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Folded Space</strong> \u2013 Discover otherworldly areas and harvest vital resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Survival</strong> \u2013 Manage food, water, electricity, indoor air, and feel the real pressure of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Sandstorms, toxic fog, zombies, and ruins bring the apocalypse to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5ef19e0837ad29bb8464d3810e392649.poster.avif?t=1768077408\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst