mysterious \u201cfolded space\u201d entrances. These hidden dimensions hold the energy and materials you need to maintain and expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every mile you travel, survival grows harder. Plan your resources carefully, fight off the undead, and keep your home on wheels safe as you push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile Base</strong> \u2013 Drive your RV with expandable interior space and build a safe, cozy home on wheels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Folded Space</strong> \u2013 Discover otherworldly areas and harvest vital resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Survival</strong> \u2013 Manage food, water, electricity, indoor air, and feel the real pressure of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Sandstorms, toxic fog, zombies, and ruins bring the apocalypse to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5ef19e0837ad29bb8464d3810e392649.poster.avif?t=1768077408\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5ef19e0837ad29bb8464d3810e392649.webm?t=1768077408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/5ef19e0837ad29bb8464d3810e392649.mp4?t=1768077408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned research laboratories and discover blueprints for folding spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947270/extras/c1062eeb8a46778f15cd6a4488a69f96.a